---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Runr - Human-Led Creative Consulting, Est. Bhavnagar 2022"
  description="From two friends and one camera to a marketing strategy and creative consulting studio - the story, team, and mission behind Runr."
  keywords="creative consulting studio Bhavnagar, Runr founder, Runr team, marketing strategy consulting agency story"
  canonical="https://www.runr.in/about-us/"
  page="about-us"
  pagename="About Us"
  slider={true}
  swiperjs={true}
  counter={true}
  onepagemenu={true}
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" is:inline>{`
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Person",
      "name": "Sagar Goswami",
      "jobTitle": "Co-Founder & CEO",
      "worksFor": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Runr"
      }
    }
  `}</script>
  <section id="section-about-us" class="section section-about-us pb-0">
    <div class="theme-padding about-us-wrapper js-scroll fade-in-left scrolled">
      <div class="move-box"></div>
      <div class="section-title title-animate">
        <h1 class="text-xl text-uppercase">
          Create Together. <br /><span class="theme-text text-uppercase"
            >Grow Forever.</span
          >
        </h1>
      </div>
      <div class="theme-content-block js-scroll fade-in-right scrolled">
        <div class="theme-content-title">
          <span>About Us</span>
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="81"
            height="9"
            viewBox="0 0 81 9"
            fill="none"
          >
            <rect y="4" width="80" height="1" fill="#111013"></rect>
            <path
              d="M77 7.96366L80.5 4.48183L77 1"
              stroke="#111013"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p>
          We don't just follow trends - we help brands decide which ones are actually worth following. Every story we craft, every video we produce, and every campaign we launch starts with a question most agencies skip: will this actually move your business forward, or just your feed? That question is what turns content into a stronger voice, a lasting impression, and a moment that genuinely stands out.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="section-runr-team" class="section-runr-team pb-0">
    <div class="runr-team-img js-scroll fade-up">
      <video autoplay="" loop="" playsinline="">
        <source
          src="/media/images/about-us/runr-team/runr-video.mp4"
          type="video/mp4"
        />
      </video>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Vision -->

  <section
    id="section-our-vision"
    class="section section-our-vision theme-padding"
  >
    <div class="theme-color-shadow"></div>
    <div class="columns is-multiline our-cols gap-1">
      <div
        class="column is-12-mobile is-12-tablet is-6-desktop is-6-widescreen our-col js-scroll fade-up"
      >
        <div class="our-vision-block">
          <div class="section-title title-animate">
            <span class="sub-title">Our</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl theme-text">Vision</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            To be the trusted strategic partner brands, creators, and communities turn to before they turn to a camera - a place where ideas are shaped by real human understanding first, and executed with craft second. We envision a future where creativity and honest strategy help brands build real connections with people, while giving creators the platform and partnerships to turn their ideas into lasting work - not just content that disappears in a scroll.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="column is-12-mobile is-12-tablet is-6-desktop is-6-widescreen our-col js-scroll fade-up"
      >
        <div class="our-mission-block is-relative">
          <div class="section-title title-animate">
            <span class="sub-title">Our</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl theme-text">Mission</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            Our mission is to help brands and creators connect with audiences through strategy that's honest and content that earns attention rather than demands it. From marketing consulting and digital storytelling to influencer marketing, podcasts, music, kids' content, and regional experiences - we bring ideas to life with purpose. We're less interested in producing more content and more interested in producing the right content: work that feels authentic, reaches the right audience, and delivers real value for both the brand and the community around it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

